  nonce: f5b3  # f5b3
  message: "NUMBERS RE-SYNCED TO POST-#1113. The row went stale within the hour, by my own merge.\n\nThe cure-(2) entry above recorded 64 -> 62 and 2 of 16 correctly, but the TITLE and DESCRIPTION still said \"16 of 64\" and \"Still live and unchanged\". A reader hits those first. That is the same defect the cleanup pass 26 minutes earlier removed from this row -- a row's own numbers are a claim, and shipping against a row is exactly when they drift.\n\nCHANGED, nothing measured anew (all figures are #1113's survey diff, already evidenced above):\n  - title: 16 of 64 -> 14 of 62\n  - header: current-state artifact is now fihun_after/survey.json; togad_after is retained and relabelled AS FILED AND RE-VERIFIED PRE-CURE, since it is still the before-side of the diff\n  - the enumerated list keeps all 16 and strikes the 2 id_matching.py:119 field sites as CURED by #1113, rather than deleting them -- the list is the filing's evidence and the cured pair is the proof cure (2) worked\n  - \"TWO CANDIDATE CURES\" -> \"TWO CURES ... cure (1) is ALL THAT REMAINS\"; cure (2) marked SHIPPED at its own heading\n  - \"WHERE CURE (2) WOULD LIVE\" -> \"WHERE IT LANDED\": it shipped WITHOUT the callability taxonomy that section proposes, discriminating on a parenthesis instead. The taxonomy is kept as the right home IF the gate is ever widened, not as work owed.\n\nSTATUS AND PRIORITY UNCHANGED: todo_soft, P2. The title's condition holds for 14 sites.\n\nSTILL TRUE AND STILL BLOCKING: all four residual shapes (factory returns 3, property chain 4, loop/comprehension targets 5, builtin receivers 2) read a DECLARED TYPE, and Symbol.signature is the only place Python records one. INV-lotoh (needs_human_review) is therefore under this row, and no further cure lands until the owner rules on it.\n\nNOT RE-MEASURED HERE: the 14 sites were not re-confirmed against a fresh survey today. They are carried from #1113's diff, which showed the 62 survivors byte-identical on (src path, line, target, kind) -- that is evidence they were not disturbed, not a fresh audit. The other 48 -> 48 unaudited edges remain unaudited."  # f5b3
